Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F,$888,$F80,$08F,$8F0,$F08,$80F,$0F8,$444
Cls 1,3,5 To 70,40 : Cls 2,17,50 To 33,60 : Cls 3,40,50 To 41,90 : Cls 4,-20,95 To 20,120
Cls 5,300,180 To 400,300 : Cls 6,100,10 To 100,50 : Cls 7,110,10 To 150,10 : Cls 9,7,130 To 9,190
Cls 10,15,130 To 31,190 : Cls 11,33,130 To 64,190 : Cls 12,129,61 To 258,66
Clip 50,50 To 150,150 : Ink 13 : Bar 0,0 To 319,199 : Ink 14 : Circle 100,100,70 : Clip
Clip 200,20 To 300,60 : Ink 8 : Draw 180,10 To 319,80 : Clip 200,20 To 250,60 : Ink 9 : Draw 180,80 To 319,10 : Clip
Ink 15 : Box 200,100 To 300,190
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/drawing_1.iff"
Cls 0 : Ink 1 : Box 10,10 To 100,100 : Box 30,30 To 60,60 : Paint 20,20
Ink 2 : Circle 160,60,40 : Ink 3 : Draw 120,60 To 200,60 : Ink 4 : Paint 160,40 : Ink 5 : Paint 160,80
For I=0 To 9 : Ink 6 : Draw 220+I*9,5 To 220+I*9,95 : Draw 220,5+I*9 To 310,5+I*9 : Next I
Ink 7 : Paint 225,10
Ink 8 : For I=0 To 30 : Draw I*10,110 To I*10+5,195 : Next I
Ink 9,0 : Set Pattern 2 : Paint 3,150
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/drawing_2.iff"
Cls 0
For P=0 To 5 : Set Pattern P : Ink 1+P,8 : Bar P*50+2,2 To P*50+48,48 : Next P
Set Paint 1 : Set Pattern 3 : Ink 2,0,3 : Bar 10,60 To 90,100 : Set Paint 0
Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 15,15 : Ink 2 : Draw 0,0 To 15,15 : Get Bob 1,0,0 To 16,16
Ink 4 : Bar 0,0 To 15,7 : Ink 5 : Box 0,0 To 15,7 : Get Bob 2,0,0 To 16,8
Set Pattern -1 : Ink 1,0 : Bar 100,60 To 190,100
Set Pattern -2 : Ink 1,0 : Bar 200,60 To 290,100
Set Pattern -3 : Bar 100,110 To 190,150
Set Pattern 0 : Ink 3 : Bar 200,110 To 290,150
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/drawing_3.iff"
Cls 0
Hslider 10,10 To 200,20,100,0,10 : Hslider 10,25 To 200,35,100,90,10 : Hslider 10,40 To 200,50,100,95,20
Hslider 10,55 To 200,65,0,0,0 : Hslider 10,70 To 200,80,3,1,1 : Hslider 10,85 To 300,95,30000,12000,500
Hslider 10,100 To 15,110,100,50,10 : Hslider 10,115 To 200,125,10,5,20
Vslider 220,10 To 230,190,100,50,10 : Vslider 240,10 To 250,190,1000,999,1 : Vslider 260,10 To 270,190,5,0,5
Set Slider 1,2,3,0,4,5,6,1 : Hslider 10,130 To 200,140,100,30,40
Set Slider 7,8,9,2,10,11,12,3 : Vslider 280,10 To 300,190,100,20,30 : Hslider 10,145 To 200,160,64,32,16
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/drawing_4.iff"
Double Buffer : Autoback 1 : Cls 0 : Cls 3,10,10 To 100,100 : Ink 2 : Circle 150,100,40 : Paint 150,100
Set Pattern 1 : Hslider 10,150 To 200,170,100,40,20
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/drawing_5.iff"
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/drawing_6.iff"
Print #1,"end"
